#@title Follow the salt through staged transfers
#@intro.1 One beaker is poured all at once. The other takes two stages. Does either route lose salt?

#@intro.2 Prepare two equal portions of salt water.
add v1 water 300mL
add v1 NaCl 0.003mol
measure v1 balance
new
add v2 water 300mL
add v2 NaCl 0.003mol
measure v2 balance

#@part.1 Give each portion an empty receiver.
new
new

#@part.2 Move the first portion in one pour, and the second in two successive pours.
decant v1 v3 1
decant v2 v4 0.5
decant v2 v4 1

#@part.3 Inspect every vessel. The route changes where the solution waits, not the total H, O, Na or Cl in each source-receiver pair.
inspect v1
inspect v2
inspect v3
inspect v4
